        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, burned in power plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, burned in power plant
na;
UUID: 4517572b-cf49-3f8a-885f-16ee249d6e0b
The module includes fuel input from high pressure network, emissions to air, and substances needed for operation.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average of installed power plants.  Only power plants with 100% natural gas firing have been considered for NOx, SO2, and CO2 emissions (eGRID 2006).
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4517572b-cf49-3f8a-885f-16ee249d6e0b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
